    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "RALPH\nPATRICK\nTCHELO\nMRS MOREL\nOF ROMEONE MELINAND\ndeb\nTants\n'de\nTN\n1500g\n-FESTIVALS\n9WS8 20 108 25 0\nPLESSES ROBINSON\n2DE SA272\nCOURBEVOIE\n40 1 012\nARGENTEUIL\nNICA\nBINDS\nCONCERTS Er DE\nKIRKPATRI\nGELBE\n-..\nVAINCU\nVARI ANY\nPAN AM\nYou could have been in Paris tonight.\nParis. Just as you've always remembered her.\nOr just as you've always dreamed she would be.\nParis. A world of high life and haut couture.\nA world of lights and sounds and gardens and\nspires and a river called the Seine. Above all, a\nworld of romance that will endure long, long\nafter you've come home again.\nSo the next time Paris tempts you, take off\nwith the world's most experienced airline.\nEn route, you can pay Paris and yourself the\ncompliment of flying First-Class President Spe-\ncial. It's a truly special world of incomparable\ncuisine by Maxim's of Paris, famous wines, un-\ncommon service, and a very real sense of being\nabove it all.\nOf course, you can fly Economy, if you wish.\nAnd you can go to other European cities, if you\nwish. As a matter of fact, we fly straight through\nHOLIDAY/JUNE\nto 27 of them from the U.S.A., twice as many\nas anyone else. Call a Pan Am Travel Agent or\ncall us direct.\nThen relax and enjoy the good feeling that\ncomes from flying the best there is.\nVive la difference!\nWorlds most experienced airline\nFirst on the Atlantic\nPurst in Latin America\nFirst on the Pacific\nFirst Round the World"
    ],
